WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.790
A window expression has up to four important pieces
The function tells

00:00:05.817 --> 00:00:11.381
us what is calculated PARTITION BY defines
independent groups

00:00:13.123 --> 00:00:19.280
ORDER BY defines sequence The frame determines which
ordered rows participate

00:00:19.293 --> 00:00:25.245
in some window calculations When a window query is
confusing identify

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.482
these pieces separately
